---
title: Bloody Mary
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, vodka]
source: Classic cocktail, number 14 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @vodka{1.5%fl_oz}, @tomato juice{3%fl_oz} and @lemon juice{0.5%fl_oz}. Add @Worcestershire sauce{2%dashes}, @hot sauce{2%dashes}, @horseradish{0.5%tsp}, a pinch of @celery salt{} and a grind of @black pepper{}. Roll it gently back and forth between the shaker and a second tin rather than shaking, so the tomato stays thick, and strain into a #highball glass{}(with ice). Garnish with a @celery{1%stalk} and a @lemon{1%wedge}.
